    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Leave me alone. I’ll return with something useful.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): The Hermit (Mystic-Isolator).</strong> You step away in order to see clearly. Solitude is not withdrawal to you. It is a forge, a lens, and a discipline.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens contemplation, covert preparation, and hidden spiritual leverage. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Faith OP</strong> and <strong>+1 Intrigue OP</strong>.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
